msgstr "Taux des pénalités de retard"

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Late payment penalties at an annual rate of %(rate)s%% are applied if the "
"payment is made after the due date."
msgstr ""
"Des pénalités de retard au taux annuel de %(rate)s %% sont appliquées si le "
"paiement est effectué après la date d'échéance."

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate.field_account_bank_statement_line__l10n_fr_pdp_late_payment_penalties_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate.field_account_move__l10n_fr_pdp_late_payment_penalties_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate.field_account_payment__l10n_fr_pdp_late_payment_penalties_rate
msgid "Late payment penalties rate that applied when the invoice was posted."
msgstr ""
"Taux des pénalités de retard en vigueur lors de la comptabilisation de la "
"facture."

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate.field_l10n_fr_pdp_late_payment_penalty_rate__period_start
msgid "Period Start"
msgstr "Début de la période"

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
#: model:ir.model.fields,field_description:l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate.field_l10n_fr_pdp_late_payment_penalty_rate__rate
msgid "Rate"
msgstr "Taux"

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate/models/account_move.py:0
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The late payment penalty rate could not be updated. The current rate of "
"%(rate)s%% was used. If necessary, reset the invoice to draft and adjust the"
" rate manually in the Accounting settings, or contact Odoo Support."
msgstr ""
"Le taux des pénalités de retard n'a pas pu être mis à jour. Le taux actuel "
"de %(rate)s %% a été utilisé. Si nécessaire, remettez la facture en "
"brouillon et ajustez le taux manuellement dans les paramètres de "
"Comptabilité, ou contactez le support Odoo."

#. module: l10n_fr_pdp_penalty_rate
